WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.171 --> 00:00:01.752
(light flute music)

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:03.112
- [Voiceover] Damnit.

00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:08.082
(car alarm blares)

00:00:08.892 --> 00:00:13.201
(upbeat salsa music)

00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:14.193
- [Voiceover] Please hold.

00:00:14.193 --> 00:00:15.095
(beeping)

00:00:16.905 --> 00:00:17.965
(knocking)

00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:21.387
- [Voiceover] Really?

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.446
- No, no, no, no.

00:00:32.039 --> 00:00:33.514
Shoot.

00:00:33.514 --> 00:00:35.571
(honking)

00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:36.478
(groans)

00:00:38.317 --> 00:00:39.224
(sighs)

00:00:39.224 --> 00:00:40.533
- Ow.

00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:41.566
(yells)

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:42.495
(grunts)

00:00:45.566 --> 00:00:46.539
(groans)

00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:48.254
- [Voiceover] Okay.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.165
Here we go, buddy.

00:00:50.165 --> 00:00:51.311
- Whoa.

00:00:51.311 --> 00:00:52.696
I'm sorry.

00:00:52.696 --> 00:00:53.538
Somebody looks hungry.

00:00:53.538 --> 00:00:54.238
- Oh, no.

00:00:54.238 --> 00:00:54.955
(growls)

00:00:54.955 --> 00:00:55.663
- Whoa.

00:00:55.663 --> 00:00:56.446
- [Voiceover] Sorry.

00:00:56.446 --> 00:00:57.151
Yeah.

00:00:57.151 --> 00:00:57.864
- I got it.

00:00:57.864 --> 00:00:58.875
(chuckles)

